@title EPISODE 25 • CASSIE'S TURN
@bg dorm_hallway_night
@show cassie
Cassie is sitting outside her own dorm room. Alana locked her out. Again. For good reason this time.
Cassie: She found the notebook.
London: What notebook?
Cassie: My... observations notebook. Everybody's in it. Even you. You have six pages.
> [Bitchy] "Six?! I deserve at least ten." -> c1
> [Sweet] Sit down next to her. -> c2
> [Bold] "Give me the notebook. Right now." -> c3
*c1
@add Cassie_Friendship 2
Cassie: (laughing through tears) You're so annoying. You're my favorite person I hate.
@jump c_done
*c2
@add Cassie_Friendship 3
Cassie: I just wanted to know stuff. If I know stuff, people need me. If people need me, they don't leave me out.
London: That's the saddest thing I've ever heard.
Cassie: I know. I'm aware.
@jump c_done
*c3
@add Cassie_Friendship 1
@add Team_Reputation 2
She hands it over. You burn it in the fire pit behind the dorm. Cassie watches and, weirdly, looks relieved.
*c_done
@show suki
Suki: (coming up the stairs) Is that Cassie? Crying? Somebody pinch me.
Cassie: Suki. I'm sorry. For the note. For the relay. For all of it.
Suki looks at Cassie for a long time.
> [Good] "Suki, your call." -> s1
> [Sweet] "Everybody here's done something messy this year. Everybody." -> s2
*s1
@add Suki_Friendship 2
Suki: (finally) ...You can run the relay. For real. You're faster than me in the third leg anyway.
@jump s_done
*s2
@add Suki_Friendship 1
@add Cassie_Friendship 2
Suki: (sighing) Ugh. Fine. Come here.
The three of you sit on the stairs eating Hot Cheetos until 2 a.m.
*s_done
@show jamal
Jamal: (from the landing) Suki. You got a minute?
Suki looks at London. London nods. Suki goes. The door closes. When she comes back out an hour later, she's holding his hand. Not tight. Just holding it.
@add Suki_Jamal 1
@load s1/ep26.mvs
